(5247347, 763808, 96751, '<td valign="top">If I''m looking at the correct original, this is indeed a vast improvement.  Love the use of backlighting, nice silhouette, just a bit splotchy in background right above the top of the hourglass.</td>', 'If I''m looking at the correct original, this is indeed a vast improvement.  Love the use of backlighting, nice silhouette, just a bit splotchy in background right above the top of the hourglass.', '2009-02-09 15:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
