(5247378, 763948, 30861, '<td valign="top">Took some courage to do this one, since it was one of the top scorers in the original Brown Ribbon Deja Vu challenge :-)<br/> <br/>You have, of course, vastly improved on the original, no question about that. This is nicely lit and processed. I do wish you''d actually scrounged up a real arrow, I keep getting hung up on the sheer impossibility of arching with an unfletched skewer... :-)<br/> <br/>All in all, a good, better-than-workmanlike rehashing of the brown, and a 7 from me for now.</td>', 'Took some courage to do this one, since it was one of the top scorers in the original Brown Ribbon Deja Vu challenge :-) You have, of course, vastly improved on the original, no question about that. This is nicely lit and processed. I do wish you''d actually scrounged up a real arrow, I keep getting hung up on the sheer impossibility of arching with an unfletched skewer... :-) All in all, a good, better-than-workmanlike rehashing of the brown, and a 7 from me for now.', '2009-02-09 16:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247386, 763018, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning image.  Wonderful textures and lighting.  Especially if it''s a remake of"turning over a new leaf".  The sepia really works here.</td>', 'Stunning image.  Wonderful textures and lighting.  Especially if it''s a remake of"turning over a new leaf".  The sepia really works here.', '2009-02-09 16:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247396, 763866, 96751, '<td valign="top">The fog really adds a mysterious quality to this shot.  Of course, there''s a HECK of a lot more detail in this than the original :-)</td>', 'The fog really adds a mysterious quality to this shot.  Of course, there''s a HECK of a lot more detail in this than the original :-)', '2009-02-09 16:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247399, 763658, 30861, '<td valign="top">Apparently this is a remake of Trish''s "Eggs frying" from the first "sound" challenge. So although this is a very nicely lit and technically superior image, I don''t really see it as having any relevance to the original image or the original challenge.<br/> <br/>If you''re saying you can improve a messy photograph of eggs frying by shooting the unbroken eggs in a basket, well yeah, it''s *neater* but it''s not even remotely the same image. If you''re saying you can better answer the challenge "Sound" (and I''m sure you''re not) by photographing intact eggs instead of sizzling, popping, frying eggs, well that obviously is not true.<br/> <br/>Had you exhibited the same degree of skill in a shot of eggs actually being fried, and managed to communicate that snap &amp; hiss of overheated grease, thn you might have had a winner, but by the standards on which I''m choosing to judge this callenge, your image is a bit of a shoehorn.<br/> <br/>Still, the skill''s there, so you get a 6 from me for now.</td>', 'Apparently this is a remake of Trish''s "Eggs frying" from the first "sound" challenge. So although this is a very nicely lit and technically superior image, I don''t really see it as having any relevance to the original image or the original challenge. If you''re saying you can improve a messy photograph of eggs frying by shooting the unbroken eggs in a basket, well yeah, it''s *neater* but it''s not even remotely the same image. If you''re saying you can better answer the challenge "Sound" (and I''m sure you''re not) by photographing intact eggs instead of sizzling, popping, frying eggs, well that obviously is not true. Had you exhibited the same degree of skill in a shot of eggs actually being fried, and managed to communicate that snap & hiss of overheated grease, thn you might have had a winner, but by the standards on which I''m choosing to judge this callenge, your image is a bit of a shoehorn. Still, the skill''s there, so you get a 6 from me for now.', '2009-02-09 16:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247406, 763846, 30861, '<td valign="top">Yup, this is completely faithful to the original, way more so than the majority of entries, and that''s good in my book. And it''s definitely an improvement, as well.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, I don''t think it''s particularly well done, it''s just workmanlike to me in its lighting and processing. In particular, it bothers me that the white, rectangular plate is so utterly dominating the image. If this was a restaurant shot (and from the setting it looks like it probably is) then I realize you didn''t have a lot of options re: dinnerware and lighting, but even so, the image just doesn''t work all that well for me. <br/> <br/>I''ll give it a 6 because it is being so faithful to the challenge and it''s not so bad a job either... It''s just that there''s so much unrealized potential here...</td>', 'Yup, this is completely faithful to the original, way more so than the majority of entries, and that''s good in my book. And it''s definitely an improvement, as well. Unfortunately, I don''t think it''s particularly well done, it''s just workmanlike to me in its lighting and processing. In particular, it bothers me that the white, rectangular plate is so utterly dominating the image. If this was a restaurant shot (and from the setting it looks like it probably is) then I realize you didn''t have a lot of options re: dinnerware and lighting, but even so, the image just doesn''t work all that well for me.  I''ll give it a 6 because it is being so faithful to the challenge and it''s not so bad a job either... It''s just that there''s so much unrealized potential here...', '2009-02-09 16:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247414, 763177, 96751, '<td valign="top">Is this from Walking Baby Shoes?  Nice - and improved - take.  Much more depth, better colors, stronger composition.</td>', 'Is this from Walking Baby Shoes?  Nice - and improved - take.  Much more depth, better colors, stronger composition.', '2009-02-09 16:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247418, 763495, 96751, '<td valign="top">Though considerably better than the original, I still find this shot needs more contrast, depth, texture.</td>', 'Though considerably better than the original, I still find this shot needs more contrast, depth, texture.', '2009-02-09 16:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247424, 763348, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is remarkably faithful to the goals of the original challenge <i>and</i> to what Whiterook was trying to accomplish, so you get high props for that. <br/> <br/>I vaguely wish you''d resisted the temptation to throw in the always-pleasing DPC cliché water droplet, but I can''t really punish you for knowing what the voters like can I? And the image is beautifully lit and actually fairly puzzling, as a macro; exactly <i>what</i> is that surface, anyway? You even managed to make an image that''s entirely *brown* (in a brown ribbon challenge) and make it look appealing :-)<br/> <br/>End result, an 8 from me for now.</td>', 'Wow. This is remarkably faithful to the goals of the original challenge and to what Whiterook was trying to accomplish, so you get high props for that.  I vaguely wish you''d resisted the temptation to throw in the always-pleasing DPC cliché water droplet, but I can''t really punish you for knowing what the voters like can I? And the image is beautifully lit and actually fairly puzzling, as a macro; exactly what is that surface, anyway? You even managed to make an image that''s entirely *brown* (in a brown ribbon challenge) and make it look appealing :-) End result, an 8 from me for now.', '2009-02-09 16:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247425, 763648, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very nice and scary close in composition to the original.</td>', 'Very nice and scary close in composition to the original.', '2009-02-09 16:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247429, 763515, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is good; you''ve stuck real close to the original''s theme and produced a MUCH more appealing image, exactly what the challenge asks for, so props for that. I''m also enjoying how you cut away all the tangle from the foreground, where it is a negative, <i>and then used it in the sky, in silhouette form, where it becomes a positive!</i> That''s very nice work :-)<br/> <br/>Judging this as an image in its own right, it''s pleasing to me but no more than that. I like the rendering of the sky colors and the clarity of the whole thing, but compositionally it''s a bit pat. In a normal challenge I''d give it a 6, but I''m going 7 here because of how you flipped the tangle so effectively, instead of just eliminating it altogether.</td>', 'This is good; you''ve stuck real close to the original''s theme and produced a MUCH more appealing image, exactly what the challenge asks for, so props for that. I''m also enjoying how you cut away all the tangle from the foreground, where it is a negative, and then used it in the sky, in silhouette form, where it becomes a positive! That''s very nice work :-) Judging this as an image in its own right, it''s pleasing to me but no more than that. I like the rendering of the sky colors and the clarity of the whole thing, but compositionally it''s a bit pat. In a normal challenge I''d give it a 6, but I''m going 7 here because of how you flipped the tangle so effectively, instead of just eliminating it altogether.', '2009-02-09 16:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247444, 762206, 96751, '<td valign="top">It always helps to show the whole cat :-)<br/> <br/>I''ve come back to recomment since I was looking at the wrong original shot.  As a result I''ve also bumped up my vote.  Still think it''s overexposed under the eyes, and the right ear (left on screen) blends in too much to the background).</td>', 'It always helps to show the whole cat :-) I''ve come back to recomment since I was looking at the wrong original shot.  As a result I''ve also bumped up my vote.  Still think it''s overexposed under the eyes, and the right ear (left on screen) blends in too much to the background).', '2009-02-09 16:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247445, 763683, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors on this.  Much easier on the eye than the original.</td>', 'Stunning colors on this.  Much easier on the eye than the original.', '2009-02-09 16:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247446, 763788, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot, but bears little resemblance to the original, not a beer bottle in sight.  Also, there is too much negative space around the window to my eye.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot, but bears little resemblance to the original, not a beer bottle in sight.  Also, there is too much negative space around the window to my eye.', '2009-02-09 16:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247447, 763906, 96751, '<td valign="top">As with the other Fur shot, this is much improved from the original. Great detail on the face and eyes.  But I find the image a bit grainy or oversharpened</td>', 'As with the other Fur shot, this is much improved from the original. Great detail on the face and eyes.  But I find the image a bit grainy or oversharpened', '2009-02-09 16:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247461, 763644, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is good but yours is going to be compared directly against the best shot in the challenge!</td>', 'This is good but yours is going to be compared directly against the best shot in the challenge!', '2009-02-09 17:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247475, 763887, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is DEFINITELY a lot better.  I think cropping out the clouds would have made it stronger.  Nice lines and perspective.</td>', 'This is DEFINITELY a lot better.  I think cropping out the clouds would have made it stronger.  Nice lines and perspective.', '2009-02-09 17:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247476, 763495, 100393, '<td valign="top">Fabulous and the original was new to me, that is fantastic in its own way too!</td>', 'Fabulous and the original was new to me, that is fantastic in its own way too!', '2009-02-09 17:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247484, 763310, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like the "noir" feel about this.  Not all that crazy about blood...  Lighting is good, but overexposed on the shirt because it is white.</td>', 'I like the "noir" feel about this.  Not all that crazy about blood...  Lighting is good, but overexposed on the shirt because it is white.', '2009-02-09 17:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247487, 762231, 96751, '<td valign="top">So much better than the original....</td>', 'So much better than the original....', '2009-02-09 17:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247489, 763799, 100393, '<td valign="top">A bold interpretation!</td>', 'A bold interpretation!', '2009-02-09 17:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247490, 763683, 100393, '<td valign="top">I thought this one would be impossible to do tribute to. So impressed you took this on - given the original, I can''t see how this could be better. You''ve made me feel a bit of a wimp with my easy subject!<br/> <br/>A 10 from me. I hope you ribbon.</td>', 'I thought this one would be impossible to do tribute to. So impressed you took this on - given the original, I can''t see how this could be better. You''ve made me feel a bit of a wimp with my easy subject! A 10 from me. I hope you ribbon.', '2009-02-09 17:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247491, 763803, 100393, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! A really good interpretation and marvelous quality too!<br/> <br/>I''m going to go out on a limb and guess <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=92864" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">halopes</a></td>', 'Fabulous! A really good interpretation and marvelous quality too! I''m going to go out on a limb and guess  halopes', '2009-02-09 17:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247492, 762285, 96751, '<td valign="top">Is this based on "your next vacation''?  This image is stunning: exquisite color, symmetry, reflection, but it is lacking the main element of the source: boats...</td>', 'Is this based on "your next vacation''?  This image is stunning: exquisite color, symmetry, reflection, but it is lacking the main element of the source: boats...', '2009-02-09 17:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247496, 762994, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wait a minute!!!  You didn''t use a plastic spoon!!!!!!  <br/> <br/>Just kidding.  MUCH better than the original in terms of lighting and composition.  I find the crop a bit awkward though. Also, the lighting is a bit harsh and blown out on the cubes, and loses definition on the interior side of the cup lip.</td>', 'Wait a minute!!!  You didn''t use a plastic spoon!!!!!!   Just kidding.  MUCH better than the original in terms of lighting and composition.  I find the crop a bit awkward though. Also, the lighting is a bit harsh and blown out on the cubes, and loses definition on the interior side of the cup lip.', '2009-02-09 17:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247497, 763631, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is textbook on how to shoot an eye (and preferable to "poking" one out...).  Color and clarity are stellar, but the surrounding skin area is waaaay too softened for me.</td>', 'This is textbook on how to shoot an eye (and preferable to "poking" one out...).  Color and clarity are stellar, but the surrounding skin area is waaaay too softened for me.', '2009-02-09 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247498, 763873, 96751, '<td valign="top">Better than the original in terms of lighting and colors.  The composition is a bit scattered for me.</td>', 'Better than the original in terms of lighting and colors.  The composition is a bit scattered for me.', '2009-02-09 17:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247499, 763280, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yeah. Focusing will automatically improve a shot :-)  Lovely variegated rose, nice colors, could use a shallower dof to emphasize the bloom.</td>', 'Yeah. Focusing will automatically improve a shot :-)  Lovely variegated rose, nice colors, could use a shallower dof to emphasize the bloom.', '2009-02-09 17:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247500, 763386, 96751, '<td valign="top">If based on Lines are Everywhere, a vast improvement.  I really like the narrow band of color, and the highly directional backlighting.</td>', 'If based on Lines are Everywhere, a vast improvement.  I really like the narrow band of color, and the highly directional backlighting.', '2009-02-09 17:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247505, 762566, 96751, '<td valign="top">Though better than the original, there is a lack of clarity and transparency to this shot.</td>', 'Though better than the original, there is a lack of clarity and transparency to this shot.', '2009-02-09 17:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247506, 763555, 96751, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the original.  Incredible clarity and crispness.  Would have liked to see you have incorporated the cup too.</td>', 'Excellent take on the original.  Incredible clarity and crispness.  Would have liked to see you have incorporated the cup too.', '2009-02-09 17:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247508, 763954, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the pocket watch.  Find the reflected images both impressive and distracting.</td>', 'Love the pocket watch.  Find the reflected images both impressive and distracting.', '2009-02-09 17:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247509, 763911, 96751, '<td valign="top">SO much better - and so very close to - the original.  Wonderful detail and colors, could have been improved with a slight sheen if you had misted it.</td>', 'SO much better - and so very close to - the original.  Wonderful detail and colors, could have been improved with a slight sheen if you had misted it.', '2009-02-09 17:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247511, 763769, 96751, '<td valign="top">Much more interesting than the original, which incredibly, has the time stamp on the image itself!!  Nice metallic tones.  I''m not sure if cropping out the upper splash would have strengthened the composition.</td>', 'Much more interesting than the original, which incredibly, has the time stamp on the image itself!!  Nice metallic tones.  I''m not sure if cropping out the upper splash would have strengthened the composition.', '2009-02-09 17:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247513, 763758, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and a definite improvement.  The bokeh is "stellar".</td>', 'Beautiful and a definite improvement.  The bokeh is "stellar".', '2009-02-09 17:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247514, 763855, 96751, '<td valign="top">My vote for most creative subliminal message :-)<br/> <br/>Beautiful eye and nice dof, although I don''t like this over-softening of the skin.  But probably due to the lighting needs of the "trick", I find the eye itself too dark.</td>', 'My vote for most creative subliminal message :-) Beautiful eye and nice dof, although I don''t like this over-softening of the skin.  But probably due to the lighting needs of the "trick", I find the eye itself too dark.', '2009-02-09 17:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247515, 763932, 96751, '<td valign="top">A popular choice.  Though the bokeh is nice, If ind the flower oversaturated and lacking detail.</td>', 'A popular choice.  Though the bokeh is nice, If ind the flower oversaturated and lacking detail.', '2009-02-09 17:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247517, 763238, 96751, '<td valign="top">An improvement to be sure.  But a much shallower dof would have made this a better shot.</td>', 'An improvement to be sure.  But a much shallower dof would have made this a better shot.', '2009-02-09 17:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247520, 762772, 96751, '<td valign="top">I honestly think whiterook deserves an honorable mention!  He has been the inspiration for so many entries!  The border on this really works well, the splash is fab, the glass shape excellent.  Wonderful "product" shot which I think will place in the top 10</td>', 'I honestly think whiterook deserves an honorable mention!  He has been the inspiration for so many entries!  The border on this really works well, the splash is fab, the glass shape excellent.  Wonderful "product" shot which I think will place in the top 10', '2009-02-09 17:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247523, 763351, 96751, '<td valign="top">Perfect use of dof.  More graduated lighting would have made this even more interesting, and given more separation between the chin and chest.</td>', 'Perfect use of dof.  More graduated lighting would have made this even more interesting, and given more separation between the chin and chest.', '2009-02-09 17:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247525, 762927, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love that this is so close to the original, and SO much better.  Great work, nice clarity, just a bit blown our behind the tomato.</td>', 'I love that this is so close to the original, and SO much better.  Great work, nice clarity, just a bit blown our behind the tomato.', '2009-02-09 17:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247528, 763314, 96751, '<td valign="top">Sorry about that 10, I mean to click next :-(</td>', 'Sorry about that 10, I mean to click next :-(', '2009-02-09 17:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247532, 763919, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Overall a bit dark.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Overall a bit dark.', '2009-02-09 17:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247536, 763893, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and colors.  I wish the handful had been smaller and thus closer to the bowl.  Or maybe the longest strand a touch shorter to be closer.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and colors.  I wish the handful had been smaller and thus closer to the bowl.  Or maybe the longest strand a touch shorter to be closer.', '2009-02-09 17:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247538, 763881, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting - and spooky - selective desat.  Definitely more depth and clarity than the original</td>', 'Very interesting - and spooky - selective desat.  Definitely more depth and clarity than the original', '2009-02-09 17:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247540, 763348, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the magnifying droplet.  Excellent colors, nice sheen which improves the detail.</td>', 'I love the magnifying droplet.  Excellent colors, nice sheen which improves the detail.', '2009-02-09 17:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247542, 762205, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and composition.  I can feel the cold.</td>', 'Lovely colors and composition.  I can feel the cold.', '2009-02-09 17:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247546, 763754, 96751, '<td valign="top">What amazing eye you have!   Incredible sharpness and detail on the iris and outer lashes.  The skin could have used a touch of softening (but not oversoftening).  The upper lashes are just too "head-on".  Could have benefited from a crimping tool or a slightly lower angle.</td>', 'What amazing eye you have!   Incredible sharpness and detail on the iris and outer lashes.  The skin could have used a touch of softening (but not oversoftening).  The upper lashes are just too "head-on".  Could have benefited from a crimping tool or a slightly lower angle.', '2009-02-09 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247547, 763640, 96751, '<td valign="top">SO much better than the original.  The detail with the sweat and hair is terrific.</td>', 'SO much better than the original.  The detail with the sweat and hair is terrific.', '2009-02-09 17:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247551, 763436, 96751, '<td valign="top">What the heck kind of bug is THAT????  Much better than the original, although the bloom on the end is oversharpened.</td>', 'What the heck kind of bug is THAT????  Much better than the original, although the bloom on the end is oversharpened.', '2009-02-09 17:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247554, 763577, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation, but I think the focus is on the leaf at the bottom.</td>', 'Nice interpretation, but I think the focus is on the leaf at the bottom.', '2009-02-09 17:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247556, 763493, 96751, '<td valign="top">The tilt really gives this an interesting look.</td>', 'The tilt really gives this an interesting look.', '2009-02-09 17:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247557, 763879, 96751, '<td valign="top">I find the composition a bit crowded and the lighting somewhat flat.</td>', 'I find the composition a bit crowded and the lighting somewhat flat.', '2009-02-09 18:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247558, 763021, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  I''d love to know how you did this.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  I''d love to know how you did this.', '2009-02-09 18:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247563, 763488, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful, but I can''t find the brown ribbon it honors.  Only voting on those I recognize.</td>', 'This is really beautiful, but I can''t find the brown ribbon it honors.  Only voting on those I recognize.', '2009-02-09 18:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5247564, 763658, 45259, '<td valign="top">i like the texture of the basket a lot</td>', 'i like the texture of the basket a lot', '2009-02-09 18:03:54.000000', NULL, 1);
