(5247572, 762285, 31637, '<td valign="top">Burning sky looks great here, exposed well, landscape is very interesting but dominates the entire frame, perhaps if this was in vertical form... but then again, in this challenge, creativity is restrained..6.</td>', 'Burning sky looks great here, exposed well, landscape is very interesting but dominates the entire frame, perhaps if this was in vertical form... but then again, in this challenge, creativity is restrained..6.', '2009-02-09 18:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
