(5248602, 763488, 100393, '<td valign="top">The original: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=444310" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/609/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_444310.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/609/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_444310.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/609/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_444310.jpg"/></a> is truly horrible! Your image is a fair representation but I wonder if you could have been a little more faithful to the overall composition; portrait orientation, a more oblique angle, and a focus on the snow layered on top of the fence?<br/> <br/>Having said all that, this is a nice picture in its own right. Good job.</td>', 'The original:  is truly horrible! Your image is a fair representation but I wonder if you could have been a little more faithful to the overall composition; portrait orientation, a more oblique angle, and a focus on the snow layered on top of the fence? Having said all that, this is a nice picture in its own right. Good job.', '2009-02-10 11:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
