(5249380, 763917, 67237, '<td valign="top">beautiful image<br/> <br/>When I first saw this image I thought "wow, great image, what a  big mistake not to include a reference to the original image in the title"<br/> <br/>It took me a while to find romi''s Sun Rise image:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=443798" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/607/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_443798.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/607/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_443798.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/607/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_443798.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Then I understood why you did not make any explicit reference to it....the concept has been completely changed which, unfortunately, means this image is a DNMC to me.<br/> <br/>If voters do not realize that, this photo could end up in the front page or at least in the top 5.</td>', 'beautiful image When I first saw this image I thought "wow, great image, what a  big mistake not to include a reference to the original image in the title" It took me a while to find romi''s Sun Rise image:  Then I understood why you did not make any explicit reference to it....the concept has been completely changed which, unfortunately, means this image is a DNMC to me. If voters do not realize that, this photo could end up in the front page or at least in the top 5.', '2009-02-10 21:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
