(5258323, 763554, 83313, '<td valign="top">Didn''t come up for me in voting, but i think I would have given it at least a 6. Very true to the original brownie, a lot more than the redo that scored higher. If I keep my eye in one place and scroll this image with my mouse''s scroll wheel, it has a weird animated effect. I may need to take some motion sickness pills now...</td>', 'Didn''t come up for me in voting, but i think I would have given it at least a 6. Very true to the original brownie, a lot more than the redo that scored higher. If I keep my eye in one place and scroll this image with my mouse''s scroll wheel, it has a weird animated effect. I may need to take some motion sickness pills now...', '2009-02-16 00:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5258337, 762560, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good choice, the hiker actually added something to the shot for me. A bit of mystery, perhaps. I had to take a few moments to decide if it was a person or a hanging leaf, however. I''m surprised this placed where it did, (I gave it an 8) but it is right next to mine, which I also thought would do better. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-16 00:26:07.</i></td>', 'Good choice, the hiker actually added something to the shot for me. A bit of mystery, perhaps. I had to take a few moments to decide if it was a person or a hanging leaf, however. I''m surprised this placed where it did, (I gave it an 8) but it is right next to mine, which I also thought would do better. ', '2009-02-16 00:25:02.000000', '2009-02-16 00:26:07.000000', 0),
(5258338, 763640, 67237, '<td valign="top">CONGRATULATIONS BROTHER ON THIS WELL DESERVED RIBBON!!<br/>What a wonderful execution. I am glad that those isanely low votes did not affect your final position. Hmmm...still trying to figure out why the avg vote from participants was more than .2 lower than the avg from non participants. Any guesses out there? Maybe those one''s and two''s came from that group?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-16 00:28:05.</i></td>', 'CONGRATULATIONS BROTHER ON THIS WELL DESERVED RIBBON!!What a wonderful execution. I am glad that those isanely low votes did not affect your final position. Hmmm...still trying to figure out why the avg vote from participants was more than .2 lower than the avg from non participants. Any guesses out there? Maybe those one''s and two''s came from that group?', '2009-02-16 00:25:29.000000', '2009-02-16 00:28:05.000000', 0),
