(5258370, 762285, 17851, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jprezant:</b></div><hr/><i> This photo is great.  Wonderful colors.<br/>BUT<br/>It''s absolutely ridiculous that this got 3rd place. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think it''s quite clever, the brown ribbon shot was too late for sunset (<u>in the sunset or sunrise challenge</u>), so its "never too late for sunrise" makes complete sense to me. Congrats Tim =)</td>', 'Originally posted by jprezant: This photo is great.  Wonderful colors.BUTIt''s absolutely ridiculous that this got 3rd place.   I think it''s quite clever, the brown ribbon shot was too late for sunset (in the sunset or sunrise challenge), so its "never too late for sunrise" makes complete sense to me. Congrats Tim =)', '2009-02-16 00:47:59.000000', NULL, 0),
