(5263377, 762779, 68769, '<td valign="top">I dont know why, but the fence almost seems a non issue, I know its there, but ??  When I opened the image my eyes where grabbed by the three separate trees, then lead across the long grass, to where the water melted on the shoreline, and around the beautiful cove. I must admit I enjoyed the journey.</td>', 'I dont know why, but the fence almost seems a non issue, I know its there, but ??  When I opened the image my eyes where grabbed by the three separate trees, then lead across the long grass, to where the water melted on the shoreline, and around the beautiful cove. I must admit I enjoyed the journey.', '2009-02-18 15:05:56.000000', NULL, 0),
